   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s1",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was admitted to the orthopedic surgery service and \nwas taken to the operating room for above described procedure.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=1670-1796",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Please see separately dictated operative report for details.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=1798-1858",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The \nsurgery was uncomplicated and the patient tolerated the \nprocedure well.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=1859-1936",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Patient received perioperative IV antibiotics.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=1937-1983",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Postoperative course was remarkable for the following:",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=1985-2039",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Overnight POD#0 Ms. ___ was kept in the PACU for oliguria.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=2041-2099",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s7",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Her output improved after 4L of IVF.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=2102-2138",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s8",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Her drain output was >400cc \nand her knee was placed in flexion for 2 hours.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=2139-2215",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s9",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "POD#1 Ms. ___ hematocrit was found to be 26 from 33 and \nthought to be from hemodilution and third spacing. 10mg of IV",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=2222-2340",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s10",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Lasix was given with excellent diuresis, 1800cc.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=2342-2390",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s11",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Subsequently, \nshe dropped her blood pressure to 80/50 and was given 12.5gm of \nalbumin as well as a 500cc fluid bolus.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=2391-2510",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s12",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Her hematocrit in the \nafternoon was noted to be 24.6 and a unit of blood was given.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=2511-2595",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s13",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "POD#3 Ms. ___ hematocrit was found to be 25 and her systolic \nblood pressure was still in the ___.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=2599-2697",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s14",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Se received an additional",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=2698-2723",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s15",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "500cc of fluid, for both hypovolemia and hypernatremia as her \nsodium was noted to be 131.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=2725-2815",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s16",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She began complaining of left calf \npain and an ultrasound was done to rule out DVT and found to be \nnegative for DVT.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=2817-2935",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s17",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "POD#4 Ms. ___ sodium was down to 129.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=2937-2974",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s18",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She was placed on a",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=2976-2995",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s19",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "1.5 liter fluid restriction and was given a 1 liter fluid bolus",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=2997-3060",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s20",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "(NS).",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=3062-3067",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s21",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Her sodium was rechecked in the afternoon and was 130.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=3069-3123",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s22",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "POD#5 Sodium improved to 137.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=3125-3154",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s23",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Otherwise, pain was controlled with a combination of IV and oral \npain medications.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=3157-3240",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s24",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient received her home apixaban for",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=3242-3284",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s25",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "DVT prophylaxis starting on POD#1.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=3286-3320",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s26",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The foley was removed and \nthe patient was voiding independently thereafter.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=3322-3398",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s27",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The surgical \ndressing was changed on POD#2 and the surgical incision was \nfound to be clean and intact without erythema or abnormal \ndrainage.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=3399-3542",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s28",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was seen daily by physical therapy.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10648673-DS-18:chars=3543-3590",
